      "writtenOn": "2025-03-31T21:57:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m guessing you meant zuul-executor, not zuul-scheduler.\n\nIt\u0027s true that it\u0027s required, but we default it to None and I don\u0027t think we blow up if it\u0027s set that way.  Maybe leaving these checks in for now is best, but maybe we should write a future change to have the scheduler process abort on start if it\u0027s not set.",
      "parentUuid": "73f12a02_c5f773fd",
      "revId": "de82e9cb2eddbd1c78f2857485866ebf36e89714",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
    {
